            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "The Code applies to all Bargaining Unit 9 employees including those on any type of leave status (e.g. leave without pay, military leave, civic-duty leave, etc.) except that it shall not apply to employees in Unit 9 who are on unpaid union leave of absence to the extent allowed by law.",
