                    353.0,
                    1274.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Each appointing authority or his/her designee will be responsible for providing accurate information and guidance to his/her employees with regard to the specifics of the Code and may from time to time offer training sessions on the Code to his/her employees as the need arises.",
